abstract: >-
  A registry-driven pipeline for single-molecule localization microscopy (SMLM): one CLI
  and two interchangeable workflow engines (Snakemake, Nextflow) drive ~50 methods across
  the localize, drift, segment, track, cluster, spatial-statistics, counting, analyze,
  metrics and render stages. Each method runs isolated over a canonical-CSV file contract,
  so conflicting tools coexist without dependency clashes.
